	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>Program Mapper | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Use LTCC’s Program Mapper to explore degree pathways, view course sequences, and plan your academic journey toward graduation and transfer success." />
	</ouc:properties>
	
	<ouc:div label="gallery" group="Everyone" button-text="Select Slider">
		<ouc:editor wysiwyg="gallery" csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt"/>		
	</ouc:div>
	
	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><h2>About the Program Mapper</h2>
<hr />
<p><span>LTCC's Program Mapper helps you choose a path to an Associate degree, certificate, transfer to a four-year university, or the skills to start a career. For each program, you can see a quarter-by-quarter course plan from start to finish, plus occupation, salary, and job-demand data for that field.</span></p>
<p><span>Each map shows </span><em>one</em><span> possible pathway, not a locked-in schedule &mdash; it's a starting point for planning, not a substitute for advising. </span><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/counseling.php">Meet with a counselor</a><span> to build a personalized education plan.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>How to Use the Program Mapper</h2>
<hr />
<ol>
<li>Select a <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/metamajors/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meta Major</a> pathway below.</li>
<li>Click a degree or certificate map within that pathway to open it.</li>
<li>Review the quarter-by-quarter course plan, along with career, salary, and demand information for that field.</li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://pathways.ltcc.edu/category/arts-languages-humanities/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/arts-languages-humanities-white-back.jpg" alt="Arts Meta Major icon" width="170" height="180" />&nbsp;</a> <a href="https://pathways.ltcc.edu/category/business-hospitality-leadership/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/business-hospitality-leadership-white-back.jpg" alt="Business Meta Major icon" width="181" height="179" /></a><a href="https://pathways.ltcc.edu/category/health-public-safety/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> <img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/health-public-safety-white-back.jpg" alt="Health Meta Major icon" width="166" height="181" /> </a><a href="https://pathways.ltcc.edu/category/science-technology-environment/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/science-technology-environment-white-back.jpg" alt="Science Meta Major icon" width="189" height="187" />&nbsp;</a><a href="https://pathways.ltcc.edu/category/society-culture-education/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/society-culture-education-white-back.jpg" alt="Society and Culture Meta Major icon" width="170" height="181" /></a></p>
